# Claude Code MCP servers — Apple PIM overlay (opt-in)
# Load via: DOTFILES_WORKFLOWS=developer,apple
# Requires: bun on PATH (brew install oven-sh/bun/bun)

# Apple MCP — AppleScript bridge to native macOS PIM apps
# (Messages, Notes, Contacts, Mail, Reminders, Calendar, Maps).
apple-mcp | bunx | -y | @dhravya/apple-mcp@latest
